1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
<font size="16" color="#ffffff">[Title]</font>

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:11,761
<font size="16" color="#add8e6">There is a happy squirrel. The squirrel sits</font>
<font size="16" color="#add8e6">on a branch. He has a nut in his paws.</font>

3
00:00:11,761 --> 00:00:19,282
<font size="16" color="#add8e6">The squirrel digs a hole in the ground. He</font>
<font size="16" color="#add8e6">puts the nut in the soil. He does this</font>
<font size="16" color="#add8e6">carefully.</font>

4
00:00:19,282 --> 00:00:25,511
<font size="16" color="#add8e6">Many nuts lie in the soil. Small plants grow</font>
<font size="16" color="#add8e6">around the nuts. It is sunny.</font>

5
00:00:25,511 --> 00:00:32,424
<font size="16" color="#add8e6">The small trees grow. They are green and have</font>
<font size="16" color="#add8e6">flowers. The squirrel climbs in a tree.</font>

6
00:00:32,424 --> 00:00:39,490
<font size="16" color="#add8e6">The forest is beautiful and full of trees.</font>
<font size="16" color="#add8e6">The squirrel looks happy around him. He is</font>
<font size="16" color="#add8e6">proud of his nuts.</font>

